  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 15.0% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.28B (15.0% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-10-12-stonex-raises-securitize-price-target-tokenized-stocks-418313\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">StoneX raises Securitize price target 50% as tokenized stock platform opens new revenue stream</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/380653/tokenized-stocks-show-real-demand-but-remain-volatile-and-illiquid-imf-finds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenized Stocks Show Real Demand But Remain Volatile and Illiquid, IMF Finds</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOOUpJNUtDZ2ZVQjlTQzBvVTBIU2Q4YURxcnJnNDZXRnppd2QwMU8zaUNRM00zbGZDUHc1OXBpOU1DeklSeVlhbk5lX202S3U2NXlmY2x5dHRuLVFlUXBfU0dadW96YXpOMF9vNDhDWms5SS1mVGpBQWVOeDNSeS13SlN5Y0JHODAtQjVFcTdqTnpleTRvZHFIZU04YTZTaEludlVBQkx6Sk1SRDdjTWswSDdsamw2VUtCUlhHa1lzRngtVkU?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenized U.S. equities offer off-hours access but carry liquidity and stability risks, IMF says</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
